  "id": "helplessness",
  "term": "helplessness",
  "definition": "Helplessness is a state of feeling that one’s actions are unlikely to improve outcomes, which can lower perceived control and reduce help-seeking or active engagement. In educational settings, it may be shaped by poor support or exclusion and can reinforce withdrawal from others.",
